          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilowo lalowo ozakumnathisa omunye walababancinyane inkezo eyodwa nje yamanzi aqandayo, ngoba engumfundi, ngiqinisile ngithi kini: Kasoze alahlekelwa ngumvuzo wakhe.",
